{"id":"7f0dfe946d37f4f4","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Trace Filter","display":"df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter — ZFC Comb9 Trace Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter","58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-trace"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter — ZFC Comb9 Trace Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-trace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter — ZFC Comb9 Trace Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal T\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\\)</span> (filter-on-a-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterTrace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterTrace}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}trace\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal F,Y,X)\\leftrightarrow Y\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\cap Y\\neq\\varnothing)\\land\\mathcal T=\\{F\\cap Y\\mid F\\in\\mathcal F\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}trace\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal F,Y,X)\\leftrightarrow Y\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\cap Y\\neq\\varnothing)\\land\\mathcal T=\\{F\\cap Y\\mid F\\in\\mathcal F\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}trace\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterTrace}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal F,Y,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}trace\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterTrace}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal F,Y,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The positivity clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\cap Y\\neq\\varnothing)\">\\(\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\cap Y\\neq\\varnothing)\\)</span> is retained because it is exactly what makes the trace a proper filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-trace</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S$ (filter-on-a-set predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterTrace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}trace\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal F,Y,X)\\leftrightarrow Y\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\cap Y\\neq\\varnothing)\\land\\mathcal T=\\{F\\cap Y\\mid F\\in\\mathcal F\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}trace\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterTrace}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TraceFilter}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal F,Y,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\cap Y\\neq\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":1406,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1742","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter.md|58-df-zfc-comb9-trace-filter]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6226ed6b29249a1a"]}